flowchart LR
  A[Seeded longitudinal generator] --> B[Patient-level split]
  B --> C[Causal feature cut]
  C --> D1[L2 logistic benchmark]
  C --> D2[Boosted-stump challenger]
  D1 --> E[Validation-only calibration and thresholds]
  D2 --> E
  E --> F[Untouched test and shifted stress cohorts]
  F --> G{Registered safety gates pass?}
  G -- no --> H[Reject or retain as fallback]
  G -- yes --> I[Mondrian conformal plus OOD shell]
  I --> J[Dynamic Action Window]
  J --> K[Release candidate]
